      "thai": "บ้านหลังนี้ใหญ่จัง",
      "roman": "bâan lǎng níi yài jang",
      "english": "This house is so big!",
      "focus": "house classifier",
      "register": "casual",
      "new_words": ["หลัง"],
      "tip": "For houses you count with หลัง (literally 'back'): บ้านหลังนี้ = 'this house'. จัง at the end adds 'so…!' — you'll hear it constantly in spoken Thai.",
